    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get News of Boxwood Studio</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, we are Boxwood Studio, a two-person indie game development team currently focused on creating strategy-based indie games!<br><i><strong>Critical Point</strong></i> is a retro sci-fi-themed casual strategy game, refined from a Game Jam prototype. We hope to escape reality briefly with space-loving players, offering a 30-minute interstellar journey.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain!</strong> Take command of the <i>Devourer</i> and lead humanity\u2019s civilization toward the far reaches of the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, the supermassive black hole at the center of the Milky Way enters an expansion phase, tearing countless planets into dust with its overwhelming gravity.<br><strong>Become humanity\u2019s last hope!</strong> In Project <i>Critical Point</i>, pilot the <i>Devourer</i>\u2014a planetary-fueled ark\u2014to guide humanity across galaxies to a new home and preserve the flame of civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trigger Fission Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your voyage, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>40+ consumable planets</strong>. Maximizing energy extraction from them is your top priority.<br>By arranging and activating modules, trigger fission when particles in a grid reach <strong>\u22654</strong>, releasing energy. Post-fission particles shoot into adjacent grids, igniting chain reactions from other critical-point particles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/720d4b54695dfc21c9fd889ee9ad9b87.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/720d4b54695dfc21c9fd889ee9ad9b87.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/720d4b54695dfc21c9fd889ee9ad9b87.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Diverse Plugins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plugins are crystallizations of human ingenuity. Unlock <strong>35 types</strong> of plugins\u2014crafted from planetary debris by the tech team, salvaged from alien civilizations, or earned through special events.<br><br>Each plugin has unique functions. Only by mastering their effects and strategically placing them can  farther\u00a0you journey into the cosmos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/a42e47663b2bf9fd3cc83a8c6758a684.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/a42e47663b2bf9fd3cc83a8c6758a684.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/a42e47663b2bf9fd3cc83a8c6758a684.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate the Starry Sea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though your destination is set, the next stop is yours to choose!<br>On the bridge, pick one of three destinations to warp. If none suit you, spend telescope energy to rescan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b1b0b53bafe4855b8da7829c132d381e.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b1b0b53bafe4855b8da7829c132d381e.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b1b0b53bafe4855b8da7829c132d381e.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Negotiate with Alien Civilizations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond humanity, the cosmos teems with other intelligent life.<br>Encounter them, choose how to interact, and gain resources! Beware\u2014not all beings are friendly, nor are all civilizations hostile. Choose your responses wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/e7b29c1ad471f588d8b61e2c64f12805.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/e7b29c1ad471f588d8b61e2c64f12805.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/e7b29c1ad471f588d8b61e2c64f12805.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Greater Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself by starting closer to the black hole or piloting different Arks. Each choice offers unique experiences, with more updates planned!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b6c76853fd6bdf1de20c502d02efe2fc.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b6c76853fd6bdf1de20c502d02efe2fc.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b6c76853fd6bdf1de20c502d02efe2fc.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A variety of retro styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only green, we have also prepared other display effects for you, the captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/2ab9c8fbfc317ce20a2e2df249ac06e2.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/2ab9c8fbfc317ce20a2e2df249ac06e2.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/2ab9c8fbfc317ce20a2e2df249ac06e2.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin at the Azure Homeworld.<br>Humanity\u2019s cradle will grant its &quot;firstborn&quot; one final act of love: becoming the first stepping stone on your cosmic journey.<br><strong>Good luck, The Last Captain of Homo Species.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain!</strong> Take command of the <i>Devourer</i> and lead humanity\u2019s civilization toward the far reaches of the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, the supermassive black hole at the center of the Milky Way enters an expansion phase, tearing countless planets into dust with its overwhelming gravity.<br><strong>Become humanity\u2019s last hope!</strong> In Project <i>Critical Point</i>, pilot the <i>Devourer</i>\u2014a planetary-fueled ark\u2014to guide humanity across galaxies to a new home and preserve the flame of civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trigger Fission Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your voyage, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>40+ consumable planets</strong>. Maximizing energy extraction from them is your top priority.<br>By arranging and activating modules, trigger fission when particles in a grid reach <strong>\u22654</strong>, releasing energy. Post-fission particles shoot into adjacent grids, igniting chain reactions from other critical-point particles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/720d4b54695dfc21c9fd889ee9ad9b87.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/720d4b54695dfc21c9fd889ee9ad9b87.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/720d4b54695dfc21c9fd889ee9ad9b87.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Diverse Plugins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plugins are crystallizations of human ingenuity. Unlock <strong>35 types</strong> of plugins\u2014crafted from planetary debris by the tech team, salvaged from alien ci