nor are all civilizations hostile. Choose your responses wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/e7b29c1ad471f588d8b61e2c64f12805.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/e7b29c1ad471f588d8b61e2c64f12805.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/e7b29c1ad471f588d8b61e2c64f12805.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Greater Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself by starting closer to the black hole or piloting different Arks. Each choice offers unique experiences, with more updates planned!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b6c76853fd6bdf1de20c502d02efe2fc.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b6c76853fd6bdf1de20c502d02efe2fc.webm?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/b6c76853fd6bdf1de20c502d02efe2fc.mp4?t=1745230344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A variety of retro styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only green, we have also prepared other display effects for you, the captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486160/extras/2ab9c8fbfc317ce20a2e2df249ac06e2.poster.avif?t=1745230344\" width=400 